tlessly.","zh":"Upstart 是領先的人工智慧（「AI」）貸款市場。我們的目標是透過使用我們專有的人工智慧模型來重塑整個貸款流程，從根本上降低所有美國人的借貸成本和複雜性。 Upstart 的市場成立於 2012 年，支援無擔保和擔保信貸產品，例如個人貸款、汽車貸款和房屋淨值信貸額度（「HELOC」）。從長遠來看，我們的願景是成為永遠在線、萬能的信貸商店，我們可以立即、輕鬆地以合適的價格自動批准借款人。"},{"en":"We're dedicated to providing the best rates and the best process to all consumers. Throughout history, affordable credit has been central to unlocking mobility and opportunity. The FICO score was invented in 1989 and remains the standard for determining who is approved for credit and at what interest rate. While FICO is rarely the only input in a lending decision, most lenders use simple rules-based systems that consider only a limited number of variables. Unfortunately, because these legacy credit systems fail to accurately identify and quantify risk, millions of creditworthy individuals are left out of the system, and millions more pay too much to borrow money.","zh":"我們致力於為所有消費者提供最優惠的價格和最佳流程。縱觀歷史，負擔得起的信貸一直是釋放流動性和機會的核心。 FICO 評分於 1989 年發明，至今仍是確定誰獲得信貸批准以及利率多少的標準。雖然 FICO 很少是貸款決策中的唯一輸入，但大多數貸方使用簡單的基於規則的系統，僅考慮有限數量的變數。不幸的是，由於這些遺留信用系統無法準確識別和量化風險，數以百萬計的信譽良好的個人被排除在系統之外，還有數百萬人為了借錢而付出了過高的代價。"},{"en":"Our platform applies AI to more accurately quantify the true risk of a loan, a capability we refer to as \"risk separation.\" This differentiated approach to underwriting has generally led to higher approvals and lower interest rates relative to traditional lending practices, with more predictable returns to our capital partners including banks and credit unions (collectively our \"lending partners\") and institutional investors. With this as the foundation, we've added layers of automation, macroeconomic calibration, and personalization that can support increasing scale and greater business resilience over time.","zh":"我們的平台應用人工智慧來更準確地量化貸款的真實風險，我們將這種能力稱為「風險分離」。相對於傳統貸款做法，這種差異化的承銷方法通常會帶來更高的批准率和更低的利率，為我們的資本合作夥伴（包括銀行和信用合作社（統稱為我們的「貸款合作夥伴」）和機構投資者）帶來更可預測的回報。以此為基礎，我們增加了自動化、宏觀經濟校準和個人化層，可以支援隨著時間的推移不斷擴大規模和增強業務彈性。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"Consumer lending is a vast and competitive market, and we compete in varying degrees with all other sources of unsecured and secured consumer credit, including banks, non-bank lenders (including retail-based lenders), and other financial technology lending platforms. Because personal loans often serve as a replacement for credit cards, we also compete with the convenience and ubiquity that credit cards represent.","zh":"消費貸款是一個廣泛且競爭激烈的市場，我們與所有其他無擔保和有擔保消費信貸來源有不同程度的競爭，包括銀行、非銀行貸款機構（包括零售貸款機構）和其他金融科技貸款平台。由於個人貸款通常作為信用卡的替代品，因此我們也與信用卡所代表的便利性和普遍性競爭。"},{"en":"On the lending partnership side, we compete with a variety of technology companies that aim to help lenders with the digital transformation of their business, particularly with respect to all-digital lending. This includes new products from legacy lending technology providers as well as newer companies focused entirely on lending software infrastructure for lenders. We may also face competition from lenders or companies that have not previously competed in the consumer lending market, including companies with large and experienced machine learning teams and access to vast amounts of consumer-related information that could be used in the development of their own credit risk models.","zh":"在貸款合作夥伴方面，我們與各種旨在幫助貸方實現業務數位轉型的科技公司競爭，特別是在全數位貸款方面。這包括傳統貸款技術提供者的新產品以及完全專注於為貸方提供貸款軟體基礎設施的新公司。我們也可能面臨來自以前沒有在消費貸款市場競爭過的貸方或公司的競爭，包括擁有大型且經驗豐富的機器學習團隊並獲得大量可用於開發自己的信用風險模型的消費者相關資訊的公司。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Origination Fees","val":7600000,"zh":"發起費"},{"name":"Subscription Fee","val":4700000,"zh":"訂閱費"}],"total":1043857000}},"peers":["AFRM","SOFI","U","TTD","CVNA"]}}